{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1d7d052b-96af-8fa8-a1a7-a81d68e86b0e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T09:14:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, happy Christmas Eve. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. Gerard McCarthy here. When I was a boy we'd skate down by the harbor on Christmas Eve, if the cove froze, and my mother would holler us in for supper. Anyway. I want to book the community room for a birthday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's lovely. Whose birthday is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My own. Eighty-five in February. My niece says I need a party, so I'm told to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, happy early birthday! Do you have a date in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A Saturday afternoon, the middle of February, maybe. What I need to know is the start date. When can I actually start booking? Do you take them now or is there a day it opens?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Let me look at how we're handling the winter schedule. [pause] Okay, we're taking requests for February now, so you can put in for it today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And who am I talking to again? Sherry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Beth. B-E-T-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beth, got it. Sorry, the cell phone isn't great and I heard Sherry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. So, which Saturday are you thinking, the fourteenth or the twenty-first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The twenty-first. Around one o'clock, for about three hours. Maybe twenty-five people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll pencil that in as a request. I'll need a phone number for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0173. Someone will confirm the room and go over the paperwork with you after the holiday. Probably Friday or early next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Anything else I can do for you, Mr. McCarthy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Merry Christmas, take care."
    }
  ],
